# Keep these out of the deployed bundle (they'd otherwise be publicly served).
.vercel
.env*
.env.local
node_modules
.DS_Store
.git
.claude

# Generated at deploy time by buildCommand (see vercel.json) — never upload a stale copy
public

# Internal data / docs — never publish
bria
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.jsonl
api/*.sql
api/*.md

# The crawl's working set. 766 MB as of Jul 2026 (sr-store.jsonl alone is 232 MB)
# and none of it is served: the app only fetches team-assignments.json and
# team-current.json, both of which live at the repo root. Uploading this is what
# pushed a deploy past Vercel's 10 MB request limit.
data

# Local safety copies of index.html
index.html.backup-*
*.backup-*

# Working notes, not part of the app
INVENTORY.md
CLAUDE.md

# Logged-in Chrome profiles used by the crawls. These hold live SESSION COOKIES
# for SalesRabbit and Amplify — uploading them would publish working logins.
# They are also ~800 MB, which is what actually blew the 10 MB deploy limit.
.sr-profile
.amplify-profile
.amplify-profile-*
*-profile

# Local snapshots
backups

# Older index.html snapshots (2.5 MB of dead weight)
index.html.bak-*
.rtr-profile-backfill
data/_market
.rtr-profile
.amplify-profile*
.slots-profile*
.sr-profile*
